<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lo! Jesus meets us, risen from the tomb;</l><l>Lovingly He greets us, scatters fear and gloom;</l><l>Let the Church with gladness, hymns of triumph sing,</l><l>For her Lord now liveth, death hath lost its sting.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
